api_keys.txt

# The root dev SQLite DB. backend/.gitignore already covers the canonical
# backend/newsflo.db; a second copy accumulates here and showed up untracked in
# every `git status`, which is the noise that makes a real stray file easy to
# miss. Anchored to the root and named exactly, NOT a bare `*.db`: a blanket
# rule would silently ignore a database somebody later means to track, and
# SESSION_PROTOCOL.md section 7's "never stage a *.db" is the rule that covers
# the general case.
/newsflo.db

# Ripple-exposure bootstrap: acquired annual-report PDFs and their extracted
# text layer. 670MB+ of exchange-hosted primary documents. The provenance
# (source.json: url, retrieval timestamp, sha256) and the findings ARE
# tracked; re-acquire the bytes with
#   python backend/scripts/ripple_bootstrap/acquire.py
data/filings/*/*.pdf
data/filings/*/pages.json.gz
data/filings/_acquire_log.json
backend/scripts/ripple_bootstrap/_sweep_*.txt
